BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Lecture
DESCRIPTION:With AI scraping every corner of the internet\, real-life event
 s being edited before our eyes\, and algorithms deciding what to push and w
 hat to suppress\, self-publishing your life is more important now more than
  ever. Your Life is a Zine discusses how your lived experiences are just as
  important to document as political events\, world news\, and historical mo
 ments. By diving deep into the personal\, you can make a huge impact as you
 r zine travels from hand-to-hand\, as it has been done for decades. \n \n\n
 This Reed Zine Fest Keynote is led by Bre\, also known as Bratty x Bre\, an
 d is being held in PAB 320 (Performing Arts Building\, Room 320).
DTEND:20260328T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260423T022028Z
DTSTART:20260328T213000Z
GEO:45.480983;-122.634105
LOCATION:Performing Arts Building\, PAB 320
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:RZF Keynote: Your Life is a Zine with Bratty x Bre
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52375353306865
URL:https://events.reed.edu/event/rzf-your-life-is-a-zine-keynote-with-bre
END:VEVENT
