CATEGORIES:Workshop/Training
DESCRIPTION:“Let’s Daydream Together” is a workshop centering radical imagi
 nation and connection! envy will be holding a creative and gentle container
  to explore our collective imagination.\n\n We’ll begin with a short guided
  meditation\, explore prompts for solo and small group reflection\, followe
 d by larger group discussions. Everyone will receive a free zine with more 
 information on radical imagination and guided prompts.\n\nThis Reed Zine Fe
 st workshop is led by Envy Estacio and is being held in PAB 104 (Performing
  Arts Building\, Room 104).
