CATEGORIES:Community
DESCRIPTION:Between the 15-18th centuries Suzhou developed into an economic
  and cultural powerhouse with an increasingly fluid social structure that d
 issolved the lines between commerce and the scholarly elite.  Join First Sa
 turday PDX  as Dr Ann Wetherell talks about some of the best known scholar 
 artists of Suzhou\, especially Shen Zhou and Wen Zhengming\, how their pain
 tings functioned within their personal networks and the subsequent commodif
 ication of Confucian painting to meet the demands of the burgeoning market 
 for Suzhou souvenirs.
