DESCRIPTION:How do ancient concepts like Yin & Yang\, Qi\, and the Five Ele
 ments relate to human health today? How does my body work according to Trad
 itional Chinese Medicine? And how can this understanding inform acupuncture
 \, herbal medicine\, and practical lifestyle advice? Come to this talk / Q&
 A with licensed acupuncturist\, herbalist\, and Reed graduate Eliot Sitt to
  find out!\n\nClick here to register\n\n \n\nInstructor - Eliot Sitt\n\nEli
 ot has been teaching Tai Chi for over 15 years. He began learning Tai Chi a
 s a student at Reed from Dave Barrett. He has also studied with Sifu Piksha
 n Ko and Sifuy Gregory Fong. He is a licensed acupuncturist who practices i
 n Traditional Chinese Medicine in Milwaukie\, Oregon.
