CATEGORIES:
DESCRIPTION:Join us for drop-in hours on Tuesday\, May 5th from 1- 3PM to t
 o talk about application ideas for a Watson Fellowship application! Whether
  you're refining your project idea or just starting to dream big\, we're he
 re to help. Sarah\, our Watson campus advisor\, along with the CLBR advisin
 g team will be happy to help you no matter where you are in your Watson jou
 rney.\n\nStop by to brainstorm\, ask questions\, and imagine what you'd do 
 with $40\,000 and a year to explore the world. The fellowship is open to cu
 rrent juniors and spring/fall seniors\, but underclass students are absolut
 ely welcome—it's never too early to start planning and dreaming big. No reg
 istration needed—just bring your ideas and curiosity!
