DESCRIPTION:Multicultural Graduations is an annual commencement celebration
  hosted by cultural centers on college campuses that celebrate diverse stud
 ents and honor cultural traditions within an inclusive space\, with a focus
  on student success and community support. This event is for any graduating
  Reedies who identify as a student of color and/or one of the first in thei
 r families to graduate from college. \n\nDuring Multicultural Graduation\, 
 graduating seniors will be celebrated and be given a special stole that the
 y can wear with their graduation regalia during commencement on Monday\, Ma
 y 18. We will also recognize any multicultural student clubs seniors may ha
 ve been involved in as well as any faculty\, staff\, family members\, and/o
 r friends who have supported their journey at Reed. \n\n\nHave questions? P
 lease reach out to Jessika Chi at chij@reed.edu
